<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Haba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Habakuki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ichitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">HABAKUKI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu achino china unabii wa Habakuki. Ichitabu cha Habakuki ng'achighalile baye na pfitabu pfingi pfa unabii kwaapfila chitabu chanyegho ng'achilonga baye chinu chochose cha Isiraeli au Yuda. Lekeni cholonga Habakuki pfayololome mala mbili na pfayalombile. Pfipfila Imulungu komwidika ukuloloma kwake. Iwanu iwasomile wopfikitsa Habakuki tsakakala matsuwa ghaghala ghayakalile Yeremia na ahala mfalume Yosia na Yehoyakimu hawang'ali wotawala. Si chitabu cha Habakuki baye wala chitabu chingi cha chibibilia ichilangusa ghamatsuwa ghayakalile Habakuki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwanduso Habakuki kaloloma kwa Imulungu ka tsakona pfulughu na iwanu wang'ali wonelighwa, lekeni Imulungu ng'amwidike Habakuki baye ahala hayalombile yapfilighwe. Songaha Habakuki tsakona aghano ghang'ali ghotendeka kuna iwanu wa isi ya Yuda. Imulungu kedika kalonga yang'aliwenula Wababeli wawakome iwanu wa Yuda. Pfipfila Habakuki kaloloma ka Imulngu yang'aliyowatumila iwanu wehile wawatowe iwanu iwali si wehile ng'ani. Imulungu kedika kalonga hata Wababeli watsohighighwa na watsotowighwa hambele. Kuya Habakuki kololoma kwa Imulungu yatende kuya yawonele libatsi. Na komalitsila kwa ukumtunya Imulungu kwa aghala makulu ghayatendile aho mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna Ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">1. Habakuki pfayanzile ukuloloma isula ya 1: 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Imulungu komwidika Habakuki isula ya 1: 5-11.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Habakuki kololoma lwakeli isula ya 1, 12-2.1.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Imulungu pfayakwidika lwakeli isula ya 2: 2.20.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Habakuki pfayamlombile Imulungu isula ya 3.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Habakuki kololoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Auno uwo usenga nabii Habakuki wayaghubulighwe na Imulungu.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Ghwe IMNDEWA nitsokulila ghweghwe unyapfile mbaka tsuwachi, naghwe uleke kunitegheletsa na kunyapfila? Nokulilila kwaapfila twodununzika, naghwe ng'ukombola baye. <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Heule undeka mbone ighehile na maghayo? Hambele hangu nakona ukuhinyika kwa ipfinu na ukwisonga, kwolawila ughomvi na ukwitowa. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Apfo ghamalaghitso ghahela ngupfu, nayo ihaki ng'aitendeka baye, iwehile wowahuma wana ihaki, ihaki ng'aihighighwa ghoya baye.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowedika iwanu wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />Imulungu kolonga, Waloleni iwanu wa isi tsingi, loleni na mkangawale ghendo, kwaapfila nitsotenda chinu mna ghamatsuwa ghenu ghamkala wagima, namwe hata mng'alongelighwa ng'amtsotoghola baye. <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Kwaapfila nitsowenula Wababeli, iwanu awala iwakali, na iwali na usongo, awala iwofosa mna isi yose na kuboka tsiisi tsa wanu wangi. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Wawo wa wanu wa ukupfukighwa na wanu iwoghuma wogha, wawo wohigha ka pfawobama iwenyegho, na ukulu weing'a iwenyegho. <verse eid="HAB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Falasi wawo wotsuma himahima kubita iduma, iwanu awo wakali kubita yumbwa wa kumuhulo yana inzala haipfika nemihe. Wadina falasi wawo wolawa kutali, woghuluka ka magengele pfayoghulukila imnyama. <verse eid="HAB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Wose wakutsa kutenda pfulughu, aku ipfihanga pfawo pfika ndita, woluta hambele ka libeho ililawa Mashaliki, woweka hamwe iwanu iwaghoghighwe wengi ka msanga. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Wowaseka iwafalume na iwatawala wowona si chinu baye. Chila ngome wawo woibetsa na woilundikila ifumvu na woiboka. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Kuya wofosa ka beho, na wotenda matotso kwaapfila tsingupfu tsawo yuyo imulungu wawo!<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki kololoma keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Angu ghweghwe ng'uli IMNDEWA baye kulawa ghumwande? Ghweghwe yuyo Imulungu wangu, kwela, naghwe ng'atutsakufa baye. Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, kuwasaghula Wababeli watuhighe, ghweghwe, yauli bambalawe kuwagangamitsa ili watutowe! <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Tsinenge tsako tsela ghendo, natso ngatsidaha kulola ghehile baye, ghweghwe ng'udaha ghendo ukududumila ghehile. Heule lelo kowona iwotenda ighehile kuya kwenyamala tulu? Hebali winyamala tulu hauwona iwanu iwehile wowamalitsa iwanu awala wana ihaki kubita wawo? <verse eid="HAB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Kuwatenda iwanu wakale ka isomba mna ibahali, ka pfiumbe ipfitambala ipfilihela chilongotsi! <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Wababeli wowapfula iwanu kwa indoano, na wowakwegha kunze, wose woweka hamwe mna ilwapfu lwawo, kuya wodeng'elela na kusekelela. <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Apfo wotsitambikila tsinyapfu tsawo na kutsidusulila upfumba kwaapfila tsinyapfu tsawo tsiwalapfila chijo ichinoghile. <verse eid="HAB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Pfihi katsoghendelela kuwalapfa iwanu mna ilwapfu lwake, na kuwakoma kwa lipanga iwanu wa tsiisi bila kuwonela libatsi?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komwidika Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Nene nitsakwima kuchanya kuna ghumnala ghwa ukubetetsa, nitsokala meso ili mbone yatsonilongela choni, na yatsonyidika choni mna aghala ghaniloloma.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Kuya IMNDEWA kanyidika apfino, “Ughandike aghano ghanikulangusa: ughandike ghoneke mwatsi mwatsi mna ghamabamba gha ghamabwe, ili imunu yofosa hanu aho yadahe kughasoma. <verse eid="HAB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Aghala ghanikulangusa ghobeta kulawila mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa, nagho ghosumkila kulawila kuna ukutsigha kwa ghamatsuwa agho, na ng'aghoghutsuka baye. Ka ghokawa kulawila, ughabete, ghatsolawila ghendo wala ng'aghokawa baye. <verse eid="HAB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />Lola, ‘Awala iwali na ichidandali watsokomighwa, lekeni yana ihaki katsokala mgima kwa ukutoghola kwake.’”<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwehile watsokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Ona ghendo, idipfai yakwaghisa, imunu yana ichidandali ng'atsokala baye akaye yake yabwihile. Kakala kwa kuwametsa iwanu wangi ka kutsimu, ng'odaha kwighuta baye. Koweka hamwe iwanu wa isi tsingi, na iwanu wose kowatenda wawe wake. <verse eid="HAB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Imunu ka ayo chila munu katsombetsa, na katsomtungila malonga gha ukumbetsa, watsolonga, “Kutsochona ghweghwe yuwilundikitsila ipfinu ipfili si pfako baye, na kwika poni tsimali tsa iwanu lekeni ng'uliha baye. Kutsoghendelela kutenda apfo mbaka tsuwachi?” <verse eid="HAB 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Angu awala iwokudai ng'awatsokutsila kwa kwidukitsa baye? Apfi ng'awatsolamka baye na wakutende ughudeme? Baho watsokughogha na kutsakuwa munu wawo. <verse eid="HAB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe tsakuboka ipfinu pfa iwanu wa isi tsingi, apfo awala iwalekighwe wagima nawo watsokughogha ghweghwe. Watsotenda apfo kwaapfila ghweghwe tsakuwakoma, na tsakuwadununza iwanu iwokala mna isi yose, na mna imiji yake. <verse eid="HAB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Kutsochona ghweghwe yutsenga ing'anda ng'ulu kwa kubunza iwanu, ing'anda ayo yutsengile kuchanya ghendo ka chibali cha chideghe, aku kwepfikitsa ka kuduhu yehile iyodaha kuchihinya. <verse eid="HAB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Lekeni ghweghwe kuighela chinyala ing'anda yako, kwa ukuwakoma iwanu wengi, naghwe ghumwenyegho kutsokomighwa. <verse eid="HAB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Mana hata ghamabwe ighali mna ubanda ghatsokulilil, na tsiboriti tsa ing'anda ayo natso tsitsokulila pfipfio. <verse eid="HAB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Kutsochona ghweghwe yutsenga ghumji kwa ukuwakoma iwanu, yukwimisa ghumji kwa kutenda ighehile. <verse eid="HAB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Angu si IMNDEWA yana tsingupfu baye, iyotenda tsingupfu tsa iwanu tsaghile mna ghumoto, na iwanu wa isi tsingi wepfe kwa kusang'ana ng'onde tsa hela? <verse eid="HAB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Kwaapfila isi itsomema wanu iwatsomanya ukulu wa IMNDEWA ka apfila ibahali pfaimemile ghamatsi. <verse eid="HAB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Katsochona yeye yomnwesa imbwali imunu wake wa habehi, iyomtenda yapatike ghendo kwa kumghidila imbwali yake ng'ali mna isupa, ili yadahe kwona pfayokala chidako. <verse eid="HAB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Kutsakona chinyala, na iwanu ng'awatsokuheshimu baye. Ghweghwe ghumwenyegho kutsakunwa na kutsenzeuka. Imulungu imwenyegho katsokutenda upatike na ichinyala chitsoghubika iheshima yako. <verse eid="HAB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Aghala ighehile ghauwatendele iwanu wa Lebanoni ghatsokupfamila ghweghwe. Ukukoma kwauwakomile iwanyama kutsokutenda upfuke. Agho ghose ghatsokupata ghweghwe, kwaapfila kuwakoma na kuwadununza iwanu iwokala muisi na wose iwokala mna imiji yake. <verse eid="HAB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Ichinyagho ichitendighwe na imunu china sang'ano yachi? Ichinyagho cholawa mna ghamabwe ghalubulighwe, nacho ng'ambe chakwenetsa ughutsu. Awala iwatendile ichinyagho wehuwila ichinyagho chawatendile iwenyegho, ichinyagho chenyegho hata ukulonga ng'achidaha baye. <verse eid="HAB 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Katsoghaya ayula yoghulongela ghumbiki “Lamka,” au libwe ling'alilonga baye, “Winuke!” Angu ichinyagho chodaha kumlangulitsa imunu? Lola chibakighwa nzahabu na shaba lekeni chahela ugima wowose. <verse eid="HAB 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Lekeni IMNDEWA Imulungu kamna ing'anda yake iyelile, iwanu wose wa isi wakale tulu hambele hake.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Habakuki kolomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Nabii Habakuki kolomba apfino,<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, nihulika tsimbuli tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">na nene nopfuka aghala ghautendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Ughatende keli mna imiyaka yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">ughatende ghamanyike keli mna imiyaka yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Haughudubuka twokulomba utwonele libatsi!<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Imulungu katsa kulawa Temani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Imulungu iyelile katsa kulawa ichidunda cha Parani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Utunitso wake wenela kulanga, na iwanu wose wali mna isi womtunya yeye.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Ghumng'alo ghwake ka ghwa tsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">na milambi yakwaka kulawa mna ghumoko ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">amwo mna ghumoko ghwake mpfisika ingupfu yake.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Kotuma utamu wihile umlongolele hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:5">na ghamajanga ghamuwinzilitsa kuchughu.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Yang'ema wima isi yohighisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">yang'atsilola tsiisi, iwanu wali mumo woghudema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Ipfidunda pfa ghumwande pfobeneka beneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">ipfidunda pfidodo pfa ghumwande pfenama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">tsinzila tsake tsa tangiya ghumwande.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Tsaniwona iwanu wa Kushani woghaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:7">na iwanu wa Midiani woghudema.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, apfi tsakuyonela maya imito?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Angu tsakupfighudubukila ipfikolongo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Apfi tsakuyonela maya ibahali haudiinile falasi wako iwang'ali wokwegha imituka yako ya ing'ondo uhume?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Tsakuwika ghoya upinde wako, tsakwika ghoya imishale yako mna ilutsabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">Na kuitenda imito ikang'ane isi.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Ipfidunda hapfikwonile pfipfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">ghamatsi ighamemile ghabita, ighamwaghike kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi ha ibahali ghaduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">na ghamawimbi ghake ghenuka mchanya.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Litsuwa na ghumwetsi tsapfima ukutsunguluka kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">hayonile imiyali ya mishale yako pfaighuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">ghumng'alo ghwa ghumgoha ghwako pfaghumeletseka.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kufosa mna isi kwa ukughudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:12">na kwa imaya yako kuwabayugha iwanu wa isi yose.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Kulawa kughenda kuwakombola iwanu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">na kumkombola ayula yumsaghule kwa ukubaka ghamapfuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">Kumhonda ichilongotsi wa iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">kumtsula ghamaghwanda ghake kulawa kuna litwi mbaka kuna ghamaghulu.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Kwa imishale yawo iwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">ghweghwe kughahoma ghamatwi gha wapfilongotsi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">ahala hawatsile ka chipfulapfumbi watupwililise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">aku wotamba ka wowakoma iwanu wahingwa iwepfisile.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Kufosa mna ibahali kwa falasi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:15">mna ibahali ina ighamawimbi ighatibuke.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Hanihulike agho nene nighudema, imilomo yangu ihighisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">imipate yangu itenyuka, na ghamaghulu ghangu ghaghudema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Nobetetsa kwa ukududumila litsuwa alila lya ukukomighwa liwatsile awala iwatupfamile.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Hata ka imibiki ya mitini ng'aisanula ghamaluwa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">wala iminzabibu ukweleka tsinzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">hata ka minzeituni ng'aikweleka baye tsinzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">wala ka imighunda ng'aimela ipfijo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">na hata ka kuduhu wang'olo mna ipfikwama, wala wang'ombe,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />nene nitsoghendelela kumdeng'ela Imulungu iyonikombola.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />IMNDEWA Imulungu yuyo ingupfu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">koitenda mighulu yangu iwe na ngupfu ka ya dondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">konitenda nifose mchanya mna ipfidunda.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>